**"Copyright Holder"** means Autobricks or the individual or legal entity legally authorized to license the Software.

**"You"** means any individual or legal entity exercising permissions granted under this License.

**"Modification"** means any change, addition, deletion, adaptation, translation, transformation, patch, alteration, port, replacement, or other modification of the Software or any portion of it.

**"Derivative Work"** means any work based upon, incorporating, modifying, extending, adapting, translating, transforming, or otherwise derived from the Software.

**"Redistribution"** means providing, publishing, transferring, distributing, sublicensing, selling, hosting for download, or otherwise making copies of the Software available to any third party.

